@startuml
participant "Spark会话" as Spark
participant "数据库" as DB
participant "数据过滤" as Filter
participant "数据清洗" as Clean
participant "情感分析" as Analysis
participant "阿里云NLP服务" as NLP
participant "结果处理" as Process
participant "返回结果" as Return

activate Spark

Spark -> DB: 从数据库读取数据
activate DB
DB -> Spark: 返回评论数据
deactivate DB

Spark -> Filter: 根据bookId过滤数据
activate Filter
Filter -> Spark: 返回过滤后的数据
deactivate Filter

Spark -> Clean: 清洗数据（移除HTML标签）
activate Clean
Clean -> Spark: 返回清洗后的数据
deactivate Clean

Spark -> Analysis: 准备情感分析
activate Analysis

Analysis -> NLP: 访问阿里云NLP服务
activate NLP
NLP -> Analysis: 返回分析结果
deactivate NLP

Analysis -> Process: 处理分析结果
deactivate Analysis

activate Process
Process -> Return: 返回最终数据集
deactivate Process

Return -> Spark: 完成数据处理
deactivate Spark
@enduml
